{
  "description": "_preference_sections: balanced placeholders removed across lines, parenthesised example fields (with nesting and Python's \\s), unfilled field lines, code fences, empty or symbol-only sections, Python's splitlines separators, padded headings, and the three refusal messages.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "script": "memory_learning_probe.py",
      "args": [
        "--account",
        "{account}",
        "--state-dir",
        "{state_dir}",
        "--dir",
        "{root}/work"
      ],
      "stdin": [
        {
          "call": "_preference_sections",
          "on": "learning",
          "args": [
            "# Profile template\n## About me\n- **Name:** Dana\n- **Role:** {fill me in}\n- **Hours:** (e.g. 9 to 5)\n\n## Scheduling defaults\nKeep 90-minute focus blocks where possible.\n"
          ]
        },
        {
          "call": "_preference_sections",
          "on": "learning",
          "args": [
            "## Standing rules for triage\n- **Always flag:** {e.g. a direct ask,\n  customer escalations}\n- **Delegate to:** (who handles what)\n- **Hours:** (e.g. mornings,\n  or evenings)\n"
          ]
        },
        {
          "call": "_preference_sections",
          "on": "learning",
          "args": [
            "Preamble without a heading\n## A\nalpha\n## B\n\n## C\n!!!\n## D\n   \n## E\nlast"
          ]
        },
        {
          "call": "_preference_sections",
          "on": "learning",
          "args": [
            "## \nempty heading body\n##No space\n## Real\nkept"
          ]
        },
        {
          "call": "_preference_sections",
          "on": "learning",
          "args": [
            "## Fence\n```\n- **Example:**\n{literal}\n```\n- **Outside:**\nprose\n"
          ]
        },
        {
          "call": "_preference_sections",
          "on": "learning",
          "args": [
            "## Fence\n```text\n- **Inside:** (e.g. kept)\n```\n- **Dropped:** (e.g. gone)\n"
          ]
        },
        {
          "call": "_preference_sections",
          "on": "learning",
          "args": [
            "## Bullets\n* **Star:** (e.g. x)\n- **Dash:**\t(nested (parens) here)\n-  **Spaced:**   (y)\nkeep me\n"
          ]
        },
        {
          "call": "_preference_sections",
          "on": "learning",
          "args": [
            "## Unicode space\n- **Em:** (e.g. x)\n-\u001c**FS:** (example)\nleft\n"
          ]
        },
        {
          "call": "_preference_sections",
          "on": "learning",
          "args": [
            "## Line separators\nfirst\u001csecond third\r\nfourth\rfifthsixth\n"
          ]
        },
        {
          "call": "_preference_sections",
          "on": "learning",
          "args": [
            "## Not a field\n- **Bold** (not a field)\n- **Key: value** (also not)\ntext\n"
          ]
        },
        {
          "call": "_preference_sections",
          "on": "learning",
          "args": [
            "## Colon field\n- **Key:**\n- **Other:**    \n- **Third:** (e.g.\n- **Fourth:** value\n"
          ]
        },
        {
          "call": "_preference_sections",
          "on": "learning",
          "args": [
            "## Wrapped\n- **Wrap:** (line one\nline two (inner)\nline three) after\n"
          ]
        },
        {
          "call": "_preference_sections",
          "on": "learning",
          "args": [
            "## Unicode\nété 😀 ١٢\n"
          ]
        },
        {
          "call": "_preference_sections",
          "on": "learning",
          "args": [
            "## Symbols only\n--- *** !!!\n## Digits\n١\n"
          ]
        },
        {
          "call": "_preference_sections",
          "on": "learning",
          "args": [
            "## Unbalanced } brace\nx"
          ]
        },
        {
          "call": "_preference_sections",
          "on": "learning",
          "args": [
            "## Unclosed { brace\nx"
          ]
        },
        {
          "call": "_preference_sections",
          "on": "learning",
          "args": [
            "## Unclosed field\n- **Field:** (never closed\n"
          ]
        },
        {
          "call": "_preference_sections",
          "on": "learning",
          "args": [
            "## Nested {outer {inner} still} removed\nkept {gone\nacross} lines\n"
          ]
        },
        {
          "call": "_preference_sections",
          "on": "learning",
          "args": [
            ""
          ]
        },
        {
          "call": "_preference_sections",
          "on": "learning",
          "args": [
            "no sections at all"
          ]
        },
        {
          "call": "_preference_sections",
          "on": "learning",
          "args": [
            "## Trailing heading\n"
          ]
        },
        {
          "call": "_preference_sections",
          "on": "learning",
          "args": [
            "##   Padded heading   \n  padded body  \n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
